  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LC045 now sees through the identity projection Select(x => x) that LINQ query syntax lowers a trailing select x to. Query-comprehension spellings such as from o in db.Orders where o.Id > 0 select o were invisible to the rule and are now proven like the method chain they compile to. Upcasts, rewrapping calls, method groups and the indexed (x, i) overload stay real projections.",
